"del USUARIO o el lugar del cumplimiento de la obligación."
msgstr ""
"For the resolution of all controversies or issues related to this website or"
" the activities carried out on it, Spanish legislation will apply, to which "
"the parties expressly submit, with the Courts and Tribunals of the USER's "
"domicile or the place of fulfillment of the obligation being competent to "
"resolve all conflicts arising from or related to its use."

